          "2\n16\na: b\nb:\n    c:\n        d: e\n    d: e\n    e: f\n    a:\n        a: hello\n    b:\n        a: hi\n    f: a\nstepik: contest\ngood:\n    luck:\n        for: you\nc: d\n1\niitp: forever",
